# Misc
*.tmp
.cache/

# Working notes and anything stateful or private to one machine: status handoffs, local
# credentials, throwaway scripts. Never committed — if something in here needs to outlive
# this checkout or be read by anyone else, it belongs somewhere tracked instead.
.scratch/

# The database EF's design-time factory writes to when a migration command runs. Not the app's
# data and not anyone's: it holds the schema and the migration history and nothing else, which
# is exactly why a checked-in copy is only ever stale. See the design-time factory in Data/.
backend/Ao3Tracker.Api/design-time.db

# Local runtime data: SQLite db, Data Protection keys, admin-persisted settings.json
# Named "appdata" (not "data") specifically to avoid colliding with Data/ (the C# source
# folder) on case-insensitive filesystems (Windows/macOS) — git would otherwise silently
# ignore new files under Data/ too. Don't rename this back to "data/".
backend/Ao3Tracker.Api/appdata/

# Claude Code session notes, checkpoints and screenshots — local to one machine.
.claude/
